%
( X WEAR STAIRCASE  -  AIR ONLY, MOVES X ONLY, SPINDLE OFF                      )
( docs/handoffs/2026-11-10-x-vernier-commissioning.md, steps 2 and 5            )
( Indicator, .0001 grad, on the cross slide reading X travel. Each step is .0002)
( diameter = .0001 on the indicator. 10 steps up, then 10 down, 5 s per step:   )
( read the indicator during each dwell.                                         )
( Today's loop: steps come in lumps or not at all. Closed vernier: one tenth    )
( per step on the indicator, every step.                                         )
#<xd> = 2.0000
N10 G20 G7 G18 G90 G94 G40 G49 G80
N20 M5
N30 G00 X[#<xd> - 0.050]
N40 G01 X[#<xd>] F2.0
N50 G04 P5.0
#<i> = 1
o100 while [#<i> LE 10]
  G01 X[#<xd> + 0.0002 * #<i>] F2.0
  G04 P5.0
  #<i> = [#<i> + 1]
o100 endwhile
#<i> = 9
o200 while [#<i> GE 0]
  G01 X[#<xd> + 0.0002 * #<i>] F2.0
  G04 P5.0
  #<i> = [#<i> - 1]
o200 endwhile
N900 M2
%
